                                "sense_id": "de1d3465-1988-3408-bbfd-61f83b1d637a",
                                "text": "[…] theyr entente was to set forthe the iustice of God, whych is to rewarde the spirituall […] wyth the blessynges promised, & the fleshlynges (the reprobate) with the plages thretned […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a430f999-59a1-483f-be46-c9388ab7f9d7",
                                "sense_id": "de1d3465-1988-3408-bbfd-61f83b1d637a",
                                "text": "But ô fraile Fleshlings, Husbands, Hard-heads, Bawdes, / Note but the end of your laciuious Match […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "782762a0-2a57-473d-aa4c-f1cfc506c175",
                                "sense_id": "de1d3465-1988-3408-bbfd-61f83b1d637a",
                                "text": "But the word of our Sauiour, though it be the Gospel of peace, is yet a Fire that inflames, a Sword that deuides. It aimes at another peace then worldlings and fleshlings dreame of ; they cast their eyes vpon peace with men, this teacheth a peace with God;"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
